---
import AppLayout from '../../../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
import Topbar from '../../../components/Topbar.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
import AppRail from '../../../components/AppRail.astro';
import Chapter from '../../../components/Chapter.astro';
import { getApp } from '../../../data/apps';
const app = getApp('roys');
---
<AppLayout app={app} title={`Privacy · ${app.name}`}>
  <Topbar variant="app" />
  <div class="app-page">
    <AppRail app={app} current="personvern" />
    <div class="app-flow">
      <Chapter num="01" label="Overview" title={`Privacy, in <em>plain English</em>.`}>
        <p class="lede">{app.name} is an offline game for iPhone and iPad. What you do in the app stays on your device. We do not run a server that sees what you've played, how long, or how high you've built.</p>
        <p class="muted">Last updated · 16 May 2026.</p>
      </Chapter>

      <Chapter num="02" label="Data" title={`What the app <em>actually stores</em>.`}>
        <p>The app stores what it needs to keep your mountain yours:</p>
        <p>· <strong>Game state and statistics</strong> like best score, total merges, chains, grain earned and milestones reached.</p>
        <p>· <strong>Elements on the mountain</strong> you have unlocked (trees, fauna, cabins, cairns).</p>
        <p>· <strong>App preferences</strong> like sound, vibration, reduced motion, chosen stone pack and language.</p>
        <p class="muted">Everything is stored locally in SwiftData on the device. No sync to the cloud, no backup on our end. If you delete the app, the mountain is gone too.</p>
      </Chapter>

      <Chapter num="03" label="Game Center" title={`Optional. <em>Off by default.</em>`}>
        <p>If you sign in to Game Center via iOS, {app.name} can submit scores to leaderboards and unlock achievements. Game Center is an Apple service. {app.name} does not see your profile, friend list or what others play.</p>
        <p class="muted">Want to keep everything private? Don't sign in to Game Center, or turn it off in settings. The mountain works just as well without.</p>
      </Chapter>

      <Chapter num="04" label="Purchases" title={`Røys+ is handled by <em>Apple</em>.`}>
        <p>Røys+ (one-time purchase, 49 NOK) is handled entirely by Apple via the App Store and StoreKit. We only receive a signal that the purchase is complete. We do not see payment details, card numbers or billing addresses.</p>
      </Chapter>

      <Chapter num="05" label="Third parties" title={`<em>No tracking.</em> No ads.`}>
        <p>There is no analytics or tracking technology in {app.name}. We do not use Google Analytics, Firebase, Crashlytics or similar. No IDFA, no advertising ID, no AI services.</p>
        <p class="muted">Third parties involved: Apple (App Store, StoreKit, Game Center). That's it.</p>
      </Chapter>

      <Chapter num="06" label="Contact and changes" title={`Questions? <em>Write to us.</em>`}>
        <p>Send email to <a class="tx-link" href="mailto:jonas@haugogdatter.no">jonas@haugogdatter.no</a>. You'll get a reply from Jonas himself, usually within a day.</p>
        <p class="muted">This policy may be updated when the app's features change. Updates will be posted on this page with a new "Last updated" date.</p>
      </Chapter>
    </div>
  </div>
  <Footer label={`${app.name} · Privacy`} />
</AppLayout>
